    {
      "primary_message": "Preheat the oven to 425 degrees F. Invert a 12 cup muffin pan and lightly coat with nonstick cooking spray. Place 4 tortillas in between muffin cups to create \"V” shaped tacos. Add cheese, French fries and clams to each taco.",
